# Version

## Current Version

`0.7.5`

## Version Type

Minor model-feature release over `0.7.4`.

This version implements the Phase 4 Human1/Human2 conversation input format at the `@office-dsl/intent-contract-model` layer. The package now exposes `intent-contract.conversation.v1`, typed `Conversation`/`ConversationMessage` records for `Human1`, `Human2`, and `system`, validation for version, unique message IDs, ISO timestamps, and non-empty text, parser support, and conversion from each message to traceable `SourceReference` entries.

The Phase 3 diagnosis, Phase 4 question routing, and Phase 4 conversation input format are model/reporting layers only; they never invent field values. Live planner, CLI, backend, and UI integration of full conversation history, diagnosis, routing, and finalization gates remains open (Phases 5, 11, and 12). No OCR or document-ingestion behavior is implemented in this version; Phase 4B is roadmap documentation only.

